  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.1.2:\n        - Fixed bug where custom assemblies were not passed to handler registration methods\n        - AddMediator(assemblies) overload now correctly scans the specified assemblies\n\n        Version 1.1.1:\n        - Added streaming support for requests with IAsyncEnumerable responses\n        - Enables real-time data streaming through the mediator pipeline\n\n        Version 1.0.0:\n        - Initial release of AMediator\n        - Provides request/response, notification, and pipeline behavior patterns\n        - Compatible with .NET Standard 2.0 and higher",
